    {
      "Name": "RunePricer",
      "OriginalAuthor": "Nabeora",
      "Forks": [
        {
          "Author": "Natsui31",
          "Location": "danthespal",
          "Name": "RunePricer",
          "LatestCommit": {
            "Message": "Expand README with RunePricer plugin details\n\nAdded detailed information about the RunePricer plugin, including features, installation instructions, requirements, configuration options, known limitations, attribution, and a disclaimer.",
            "Hash": "8304bb31dc933714227e522714d4b5790485cf79",
            "Author": "danthespal",
            "Date": "2026-09-10T12:31:28Z"
          },
          "Releases": [
            {
              "Id": "v1.2.8",
              "Title": "RunePricer v1.2.8",
              "FilesAttached": [
                "RunePricer.zip"
              ],
              "Description": "- bug fix",
              "Date": "2026-09-10T12:31:28Z"
            },
            {
              "Id": "v1.2.7",
              "Title": "RunePricer v1.2.7",
              "FilesAttached": [
                "RunePricer.zip"
              ],
              "Description": "### Changed\r\n- The Runeshape panel search now uses the host\u0027s fast UI readers instead of its own memory offsets. That makes it faster (one read per panel instead of one per child) and less likely to break after game patches.\r\n- Rebuilt against SDK 0.18.0 (from 0.12.0).",
              "Date": "2026-09-10T12:31:28Z"
            },
            {
              "Id": "v1.2.6",
              "Title": "RunePricer v1.2.6",
              "FilesAttached": [
                "RunePricer.zip"
              ],
              "Description": "## Fixes\r\n- Fixed a rare freeze/crash while the overlay was building its internal UI cache.\r\n- RunePricer: Rune-encounter prices now show correctly on the World overlay and the Large/Mini Map \u2014 previously they only - appeared on the reward selection panel.\r\n- RunePricer: Fixed the plugin losing track of the reward panel and rune encounters after the latest game update.\r\n- RunePricer: Removed an inaccurate estimated price that could appear for some uncut gem rewards.\r\n\r\n## Improved\r\n- RunePricer: Reduced overhead when tracking multiple rune encounters, for smoother performance in busy Expedition areas.\r\n- RunePricer: Fixed a potential crash when the game window is minimized.",
              "Date": "2026-09-10T12:31:28Z"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
      "Description": "",
      "EndorsedAuthor": "danthespal"
    },
